    "description": "Payne Lindsey and team have headed back to Ocilla, Georgia to pick up where the first season of his smash hit true crime podcast left off, and it will all be documented in a one night television special for Oxygen Media. Their investigation lead to the arrest of two men who plead not guilty and are still awaiting trial for the disappearance and murder of Tara Grinstead, but the suspects' legal maneuvering so far proves there are still many questions left unanswered. For the first time, fans of the podcast will get a look at Payne and crew as they show the audience all of the evidence they already found and fit it together with the new pieces emerging from pre-trial transcripts and interviews.",
